[{"title":"会稽颂 其六","author":"诸葛兴","text":"典午西兮金谷辈，渡而东兮蔼多士。\n嘉内史兮屏浮华，淡物累兮颐天粹。\n升冶城兮遐想，友东山兮雅志。\n修禊事兮兰亭，觞曲水兮群英。\n追雩风兮涵泳，渺万化兮均平。\n纪清游兮感慨，剡形忘兮神诣。\n蔚翔凤兮一札，宝连城兮千祀。\n太傅起兮为苍生，扶晋鼎兮蹙苻秦。\n内史归兮乐山水，师万石兮饬子孙。\n出与处兮两贤，意易地兮皆然。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60427,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽颂 其八","author":"诸葛兴","text":"虬髯起兮龙翔，耀兵威兮八方。\n法羽林兮严禁卫，握钩陈兮扫欃枪。\n视诸将兮哙等伍，咨旧臣兮忠且武。\n耸万目兮矩矱，卫九重兮心膂。\n维东南兮都会，辱吾王兮镇抚。\n畅威惠兮千载，隤福祥兮兹土。\n瞻衮服兮煌煌，荐蕙肴兮葵觞。\n匪震慑兮罗池，亶爱思兮桐乡。\n王之泽兮流后裔，更累叶兮奋忠义。\n孰旌表兮陪庙祀，显一门厉斯世。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60428,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽颂 其七","author":"诸葛兴","text":"山簇簇兮环湖，水淼淼兮萦纡。\n人何游兮明镜，鸟何飞兮画图。\n怀贺老兮今昔，想逸致兮林庐。\n老之襟兮天阔，老之神兮秋月。\n飞翰兮龙鸾，吐词兮冰雪。\n际熙运兮开元，司缛典兮春官。\n凌玉霄兮倚华盖，骖骏驭兮升西昆。\n俄清梦兮绵绵，恍乘云兮登仙。\n觐紫皇兮玉宸，聆九奏兮钧天。\n笺天公兮遂志，鼓予枻兮锦里。\n吾朋兮鸥鹭，吾宾兮烟水。\n野服兮蹁跹，斑衣兮娭戏。\n缅高贤兮非苟于去就，其庶几兮东门之傅鸱夷之子。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60429,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽颂 其九","author":"诸葛兴","text":"悄丛祠兮江之湄，懔予心兮肃祗。\n表卓行兮尚之祀，垂妙辞兮淳之碑。\n嗟窈窕兮践天性，一念烈兮万古镜。\n山眉兮苍苍，江练兮茫茫。\n江之水兮可谒，娥之灵兮不可歇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60430,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽颂 其四","author":"诸葛兴","text":"睇禹陵兮岿然，邃珍馆兮蟺蜎。\n敞别室兮遗象，崇英霸兮千年。\n谂越民兮非黩祀，推世家兮自迁史。\n肇无馀兮开国，传后裔兮奋起。\n痛夫椒兮深衄，同国人兮劳佚。\n采蕺兮食何味，尝胆兮志密笃。\n封以内兮种所司，阃以外兮蠡所知。\n羌厉志兮澡耻，迄乘时兮决机。\n盟上国兮王致胙，按山南兮恢土宇。\n陟鉴台兮睨东海，矩天门兮模地户。\n惜规图兮不弘，几弓藏兮犬烹。\n蹇七术兮遗恨，怅五湖兮遐征。\n尚蝉嫣兮复续，终与享于鼻祖之庭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60431,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"会稽颂 其二","author":"诸葛兴","text":"肇三圣兮传一中，建人极兮参洪濛。\n元圭锡兮汝绩，昭华归兮汝躬。\n大道公兮均嬗继，家天下兮繇姒氏。\n嵩石兮发祥，讴歌兮与子。\n誓甘野兮服叛，养国老兮贵齿。\n席不重兮味不贰，琴瑟屏兮钟鼓置。\n思皇训兮克俭，心敬承兮敢坠。\n祀四百兮绵景祚，兆大横兮垂异世。\n越山兮蜿蜒，镜水兮漪涟。\n焕祠宫兮屹峙，肃庑祀兮愉然。\n端冕兮龙章，执圭兮琳琅。\n想规重兮矩叠，恍韶奏兮铿锵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60432,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"海边僧寺绝笔","author":"诸葛梦宇","text":"孤臣垂死愈心伤，捲土重来岂望还。\n万里海涛鸣战鼓，千年灵气结浮山。\n鱼龙亦解齐殊类，犬马谁教到此间。\n留得御风魂不散，直须号哭叩天关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60433,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"华阳山堂落成","author":"诸葛舜臣","text":"小筑菟裘石磴间，登临极望意苍然。\n三更栗叶中峰雨，四月桃花一洞天。\n时听茅君归碧落，恍闻玉女鍊丹铅。\n江湖万里尘埃远，留得深山一道泉。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60434,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乞休得旨谢恩","author":"诸葛赓","text":"三疏陈情始放归，萧萧白发解朝衣。\n未营别业王官谷，先驾扁舟严子矶。\n视草龙螭犹眷恋，还家鸥鹭自光辉。\n老臣恩遇知何极，梦到天门觐紫薇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60435,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归休亭 其二","author":"诸葛赓","text":"日影初升竹半篙，一天晴色读离骚。\n凭栏对客浮樽斝，隔水听人正桔槔。\n拂去梁尘饯乳燕，扫归松栗煮秋涛。\n柴门正对青青柳，浪说新诗欲拟陶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60436,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归休亭 其三","author":"诸葛赓","text":"水国微茫境不凡，箨冠萝带芰荷衫。\n云归洞口鹿常卧，叶落巢门鸟自衔。\n采药道人过峭壁，汲泉童子下层岩。\n名山书卷封题处，多少烟霞护玉函。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60437,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"归休亭 其一","author":"诸葛赓","text":"小筑危亭聚石淙，清溪环绕不通江。\n栽成傲骨梅千树，呼出栖云鹤一双。\n垂钓艇乘新涨水，摊书光借夕阳窗。\n勋名事事皆堪避，只有诗情未肯降。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60438,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋日得王介甫书","author":"诸葛赓","text":"数亩池塘一小亭，从容书札户常扃。\n闲开松菊花三径，时贮蔘苓酒一瓶。\n望去春痕青到水，飞来凫羽白连汀。\n是谁日落吹长啸，犹有行人不忍听。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60439,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"诸葛赓","text":"上天下地极高深，幻化无踪何处寻。\n山静白云归洞口，水清明月落波心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60440,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"青玉案","author":"谈元范","text":"虾须帘上银钩小。\n筵内轻寒绕。\n红叶徵香侵语笑。\n金钗珠履，凤箫龟鼓，疑是蓬莱岛。\n萱堂日日春生貌。\n嫩绿休然鬓边好。\n赋得修龄应不少。\n年年长见，画梁双燕，楼外青袍草。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60441,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"点绛唇","author":"谈羲仲","text":"冰玉神人，岁寒时节迎初诞。\n照溪梅绽。\n秀岭孤松远。\n香雾氤氲，不放重帘卷。\n歌声缓。\n酒杯深劝。\n此会年年见。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60442,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"满庭芳","author":"谈羲仲","text":"星宿呈祥，溪山钟秀，果然生此真贤。\n冰清玉润，还称岁寒天。\n正是梅梢酝雪，探江南，春信先传。\n庭轩爽，涓涓皎月，今夜十分圆。\n开筵。\n称寿处，歌尘飞动，舞袖蹁跹。\n愿公与椿松，对阅天年。\n第恐宏才重望，不容暂吟醉苕川。\n龙光近，行看凤诏，来自日华边。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60443,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"题魏鹏卧屏","author":"贾云华","text":"花柳芳菲二月时，名园剩有牡丹枝。\n风流杜牧还知否，莫恨寻春去较迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60444,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"贾云华","text":"斜亸香云倚翠屏，纱衣先觉露华零。\n谁云天上无离合，看取牵牛织女星。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60445,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"魏鹏负期醉卧戏题练裙","author":"贾云华","text":"暮雨朝云少定踪，空劳神女下巫峰。\n襄王自是无情绪，醉卧明月花影中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60446,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"诗一首","author":"贾公望","text":"倏忽向六十，萍蓬无奈何。\n丹心犹奋迅，白首分蹉跎。\n正直士流少，倾邪朋类多。\n阳光一销铄，不复见妖魔。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60447,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临江仙","author":"贾少卿","text":"月寺星轺尘梦断，如今平地仙人。\n烟霞卷起旧精神。\n焚香金鸑鷟，书奏玉麒麟。\n闻道枫宸求侍从，看庆命重新。\n且将风月剩酬身。\n樽中长有酒，花下不辜春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60448,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"贾仲颖","text":"灯花寒影里，诗句雨声中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60449,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"三段锦","author":"贾似道","text":"麻头青项翅销金，体白牙长六足明。\n更有异常腰背阔，蜀川三段锦花名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60450,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"于潜道中","author":"贾似道","text":"数家烟火深村里，几处牛羊落日中。\n客久不归心事远，梧桐叶叶是秋风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60451,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乌头金翅","author":"贾似道","text":"乌头青项翅金黄，腿脚班狸肉带苍。\n牙钳更生乌紫色，诸虫见了岂能当。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60452,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"斗法八条 其一","author":"贾似道","text":"比头比项比身材，若大分毫便拆开。\n尾短更兼须又秃，强将他斗不担财。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60453,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"长衣","author":"贾似道","text":"长衣须养青金翅，腿脚玲珑尾要齐。\n总然口似青锋剑，只宜口快不宜迟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60454,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"玉锄头","author":"贾似道","text":"黑牙黑面不堪收，此等虫儿莫去求。\n若得面肥头脚大，杜家名号玉锄头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60455,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"甲戌寒食","author":"贾似道","text":"寒食家家插柳枝，留春春亦不多时。\n人生有酒须当醉，青冢儿孙几个悲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60456,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"白麻头","author":"贾似道","text":"麻头白面白如银，细丝透顶根根明。\n更加青项长肥腿，战斗之时必定赢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60457,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"竹","author":"贾似道","text":"松阴半坛日，竹声一槛秋。\n每番看鹤过，疑似有仙游。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60458,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"红头","author":"贾似道","text":"红如血点项朱砂，入手观来一朵花。\n一朝二广交锋胜，到底终须不恋家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60459,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"红头额","author":"贾似道","text":"红头虽然似花枝，早秋虽胜未为奇。\n再来得胜亦不可，胜少输多何必疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60460,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"红铃 其二","author":"贾似道","text":"红肩红肋及红铃，止有三场两次赢。\n脱下红铃休要斗，总然赢得也无名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60461,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"红铃 其一","author":"贾似道","text":"红肩红胁不为奇，连连赢得也防虞。\n今铃落了终难复，无情去斗却成灰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60462,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"红铃月头额","author":"贾似道","text":"虫名月额及红铃，来往交锋暂或赢。\n纵然得胜终难久，赢得钱来不可行。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60463,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"红麻头","author":"贾似道","text":"红麻秉性敌刚强，赤项红班脚■长。\n翅紫牙湾如桑剪，诸虫交口便难当。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60464,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论土蜂形","author":"贾似道","text":"尖翅名呼是土蜂，紫黄色者实难逢。\n这般色样如君得，不比常虫是毒虫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60465,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论乌鸦色","author":"贾似道","text":"黑色明如黑漆光，白牙绣项皂罗裳。\n肚皮腿脚皆如玉，内相将军不可当。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60466,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论水红色","author":"贾似道","text":"水红须尾水红衣，白肚团员模样奇。\n班点一些浑不染，傍人号作杜公儿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60467,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论头 其一","author":"贾似道","text":"大头圆结抱，脑搭浅无多。\n丝路根根透，光明亮不摩。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60468,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论头 其二","author":"贾似道","text":"昏小脑搭重，路粗半节儿。\n棠梨三角额，此等不须题。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60469,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论玉蜂形","author":"贾似道","text":"尖翅名呼是玉蜂，千中难遇实难逢。\n如君遇著须不避，不比寻常是毒虫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60470,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论灰青色","author":"贾似道","text":"颜色深沉不好看，灰头灰项不新鲜。\n只因翅皱长牙齿，斗相凶顽必抢前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60471,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论肉 其一","author":"贾似道","text":"紫黑苍黄肉，青白胜鹅梨。\n黑青肉亦白，淡黄白亦宜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60472,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论枣核形","author":"贾似道","text":"身如枣核两头尖，仔细观来却是船。\n交锋便见强中口，咬退诸虫不敢前。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60473,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论枣核形","author":"贾似道","text":"身如枣核两头尖，左右观来是块砖。\n往来千遍无辞口，一秋咬败万千千。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60474,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论河蟹色","author":"贾似道","text":"赤色却如河蟹色，麻头秀项极难得。\n枣红牙齿尽相宜，只恐项光头又黑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60475,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论油丹色","author":"贾似道","text":"黑头青项翅油丹，腿脚牙长似雪霜。\n相貌这般无觅处，斗时绝胜岂寻常。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60476,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论项 其四","author":"贾似道","text":"鳖小更短促，无毛一片光。\n这般生像者，不养又何妨。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60477,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论项 其二","author":"贾似道","text":"紧隘花班项，无毛黑漆光。\n纵有完颜勇，终须受祸殃。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60478,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论真青色","author":"贾似道","text":"青金头象菩提子，头上毛青靛染成。\n若还钳得芝麻白，请君斗尽莫疑生。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60479,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论真紫色","author":"贾似道","text":"紫者须当要色浓，更兼肋腿与身同。\n头雌腰阔阴阳翅，赢尽埸中独请功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60480,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论翅 其二","author":"贾似道","text":"膏药积不绉，松短阔长同。\n金紫须长翅，其馀只在中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60481,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论淡青色","author":"贾似道","text":"头紫葡萄项掺青，正身厚阔似鸦明。\n壳纹淡薄轻银翅，斗著交锋速便赢。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60482,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论脸 其一","author":"贾似道","text":"五色诸虫脸，锄弯注地长。\n再如锅底黑，此物号强良。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60483,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论蚱蜢形","author":"贾似道","text":"头大肩尖腿脚长，秀钉模样最难当。\n侧生身分高而厚，斗到秋深赢满场。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60484,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论腿 其二","author":"贾似道","text":"短鳖兼穷细，屁勋青黑同。\n只好留墙壁，何须问主公。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60485,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论蜘蛛形","author":"贾似道","text":"身材局促似蜘蛛，且喜牙长六足铺。\n羽翼不长肩盖尽，等闲觅得夜明珠。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60486,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论蝴蜂形","author":"贾似道","text":"貌若蝴蜂腿脚纤，细腰项紧两头尖。\n遍身黄色金纹理，百口之中一口钳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60487,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论蝴蜂形","author":"贾似道","text":"头尖肚大象蝴蜂，两翅含开腿脚穷。\n此虫只好无钱斗，当真必害主人翁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60488,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论蝼蝈形","author":"贾似道","text":"蝼蝈之形最难相，牙长腿短头尖亮。\n尾豁过肩三二分，正是雌头拖肚样。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60489,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"论蟹踞形","author":"贾似道","text":"蛩身弓起如蟹踞，不拘五色或麻头。\n任人观看则不怕，此是名虫何处求。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60490,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"阴阳牙","author":"贾似道","text":"此虫生来两个牙，一红一白实堪誇。\n不拘五色麻头者，一见诸虫不怕他。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60491,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"齐膂翅","author":"贾似道","text":"中秋齐膂最为英，头项宽舒翅皱文。\n敦厚牙长兼脚大，金风才动不堪闻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60492,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"两头鎗","author":"贾似道","text":"须无尾短最堪伤，虫大终须不是强。\n两尾腿长还倒插，闻名尽说两头鎗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60493,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呆物 其一","author":"贾似道","text":"定知黑白全无用，须信青黄不可欺。\n若是狭长终有失，身形厚阔最迷痴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60494,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"杨柳","author":"贾似道","text":"燕子楼边柳色新，画眉人去镜生尘。\n来年羞结空床梦，闲拨琵琶过一春。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60495,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"纯红","author":"贾似道","text":"眼如椒核遍身红，尾项如朱腿亦同。\n若逢敌手君休怕，数番咬死又成功。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60496,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"斗法八条 其七 惜才","author":"贾似道","text":"雄师百战百番赢，不可交他出阵频。\n身弱难禁生力对，一时托大误虫身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60497,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"斗法八条 其五 六不斗法","author":"贾似道","text":"荡胲无后芡，不食又延笼。\n啮牙并炼齿，终须落下锋。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":60498,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}}]